# Zenodo assigns it rather than reading it.
# doi: "10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX"

# The paper below is the earlier study this benchmark grew out of. It is
# NOT a citation for the software; cite the software above for ShortSeq
# itself, and this only when referring to the original empirical results.
references:
